Package: macrodashboard
Title: Data Pipeline for the Macro & Fiscal Monitor
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Elio", "Bolliger", email = "bolliger.elio@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fetches macroeconomic and public finance data from the IMF, OECD, BIS,
    Eurostat and ECB and writes the JSON files read by the dashboard. Not a package to
    install; this file lists the dependencies for GitHub Actions.
Imports:
    dplyr,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    purrr,
    readr,
    readxl,
    tidyr
Encoding: UTF-8
